Package: keyboard-led
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, inotify-tools
Description: Keep keyboard Scroll Lock LED enabled
 A small helper script that turns on the keyboard Scroll Lock LED and
 keeps it on while the device is active.
